Subject: [PATCH 57/61] Celadon shops: herbs, PP restorers and Max Revive

Battle consumables you could only find before:
- Berry stand: Energy Powder and Heal Powder from the start; Energy Root,
  Revival Herb, White Herb and Mental Herb after Erika (the held herbs
  now cost 2,000).
- 5F X-item clerk: Ether and Elixir after Erika; Max Ether, Max Elixir
  and Max Revive after the Champion.
The spoiler guide labels the new shop tiers. tools/hack/consumables_shop.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
